  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueSegments:
  - 'The Eastern Altar awaits you.

    Restore its sacred lanterns, and Aurelian
    will emerge from the darkness.'
  - Remember, you need not face him alone. My promise still stands.
  - I fear what we may find when we confront him... but I fear even more what will
    happen if we do nothing.
  _dialogueText: 'The Eastern Altar awaits you.

    Restore its sacred lanterns,
    and Aurelian will emerge from the darkness.

    Remember, you need not face
    him alone. My promise still stands.

    I fear what we may find when we confront
    him... but I fear even more what will happen if we do nothing.'
